# CIMTool test project: hidden files that CIMTool and Eclipse regenerate locally.
# Profiles/.<profile>.puml are the live PlantUML preview diagrams;
# .asciidoctorconfig.adoc is created automatically by the Eclipse AsciiDoc editor.
# The project's own settings files (.project, .cimtool-settings, .builder-preferences,
# .cimtool-global-preferences, .copyright-*) are kept under version control.
builder-submissions/CIMTool-Test-Project/Profiles/.*
builder-submissions/CIMTool-Test-Project/.asciidoctorconfig.adoc
